# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites tracked files to CRLF and
# breaks two things at once: a shell script carrying CRLF fails to start with a confusing
# "bad interpreter" error, and scripts/check.sh explicitly fails any shipped file that
# contains CRLF, so the repository would reject its own checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
